<title>JAPAN: Takasago Electric to issue 40 mln Sfr CB.</title>
<headline>Takasago Electric to issue 40 mln Sfr CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Takasago Electric Industry Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Kokusai Bank (Switzerland) Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE -</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO		AMT   40 million Sfr</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 30.Jun.01</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p>CONV FROM 21.Mar.97  CONV TO 20.Jun.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 20.Mar.97  INT PAY end Jun/Dec</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 4.Mar.97  SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon, conversion price and currency rate will be decided on March 4.</p>
